{"id":"n55698-1-7","stage":4,"title":"면도기 · 剃须刀","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55698-1-7-1","ko":"이건 남자가 쓰는 면도기가 아닌 것 같은데 뭐죠?","zh":"这看起来不是男性用的剃须刀，那是什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이건","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이건","audio":"/audio/5a674df42cc1d8ac9ff2.mp3"}},{"text":"남자가","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자가","audio":"/audio/2febf4b5eefa29bbf8ef.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰는","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰는","audio":"/audio/6f8201be65ab164072c8.mp3"}},{"text":"면도기가","meaning":"剃须刀，刮脸刀，刮毛刀","explanation":"면도기：剃须刀，刮脸刀，刮毛刀；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"면도기","audio":"/audio/f2f2d5cc9d344418d550.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55698","senseId":"1","lemma":"면도기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"면도기가","audio":"/audio/499b79fe88502e1919a3.mp3"}},{"text":"아닌","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"아닌","audio":"/audio/abf14847af50c8c65e3b.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아닌","audio":"/audio/abf14847af50c8c65e3b.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데","meaning":"那样的，类似的","explanation":"같다：那样的，类似的；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"3","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐죠?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐죠","audio":"/audio/0a7b1067d67ec87b4c35.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子，男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"作为男性出生的人。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"f2f2d5cc9d344418","term":"면도기","zh":"剃须刀，刮脸刀，刮毛刀","audio":"/audio/f2f2d5cc9d344418d550.mp3","entryId":"55698","definition":"剃刮长脸或身上的胡须或细毛时用的器具。","pronunciation":["면ː도기"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"那样的，类似的","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"表示与某物属于近似的种类。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/4d162ee11